  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are a difficult target for giants to pin down.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Earth Child Style<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> While using Earth Child Style, you add one-third your mythic tier (minimum +1) to your dodge bonus to AC against creatures with the giant subtype, and you also add this bonus on Reflex saves against exceptional, supernatural, or spell-like abilities used by such creatures. In addition, you can expend one use of your mythic power to enter Earth Child Style as an immediate action even if you are flat-footed, gaining the benefits of uncanny dodge against all creatures with the giant subtype for a number of rounds equal to your mythic tier. During this time, non-mythic giants treat you as if you also had improved uncanny dodge.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc97\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
